                            <a href="https://www.neopets.com/search.phtml?selected_type=object&amp;string=Hairspray"
                                ><b>Hairspray</b></a
                            >
                            is not healthy for our fur, especially if we want to win the
                            <a href="https://www.neopets.com/beauty/index.phtml"><b>Beauty Contest</b></a> or look our best.
                        
                        </p>
                        
                        <font size="4" color="#FF0000">WARNING</font>
                        <font>: 
