                        </center>
                        
                        <p>
                            As you can tell, us Usuls all have one thing in common, which is to be the best at whatever we
                            put our little tails to. But Ursula is the ultimate Usul in Neopia. It's pretty much all about
                            <b>Usul Power!</b>
                        </p>
                        
                        <center>
                            <img
                                src="//images.neopets.com/items/toy_rainbowusul.gif"
