                            <img
                                src="//images.neopets.com/items/toy_rainbowusul.gif"
                                width="80"
                                height="80" />
                        </center>
                        
                        <p>
                            Not all Usuls are friendly, love grooming, and helping others... well, there's one Usul out
                            there that we should all be very afraid of. *GULP* The Shadow Usul.
                        </p>
                        
                        <center>
                        
                            <a href="https://www.neopets.com/evil/showcreature.phtml?villain=5">
